To: {{to}}
Subject: RESET LINK
Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8

<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <title>Reset Password</title>
    </head>
    <body>
        <h1>Welcome {{username}}</h1>
        
        <br>
        
        <p>We've received a password reset request for your account at the email address provided.</p>
        
        <p>If this was you, click the button below to be redirected to the <strong>password reset link</p>
        
        <br>
        
        <a href="{{link}}">RESET PASSWORD</a>

        <br>
        
        <p>If you did not send this request, please ignore it or delete this message.</p>
        
        <p>
            This email was sent automatically.
    
            Please do not reply to it.
        </p>
    </body>
</html>